        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Hn 64.2" corresp="#wit-lat"><pb n="584" ed="#liebermann"/>In furto et murdro et prodicione et incendio et domus<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="l" target="#Hn_64-2.lnote.oe.l"/> infraccione et eis<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="11" target="#Hn_64-2.lnote.oe.11"/> que ad diffaccionem pertinent, omnes fracto<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="d" target="#Hn_64-2.lnote.oe.d"/> sacramento<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="12" target="#Hn_64-2.lnote.oe.12"/> iurent in<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="13" target="#Hn_64-2.lnote.oe.13"/> Westsexa, exceptis thainis et presbyteris<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="m" target="#Hn_64-2.lnote.oe.m"/> et eis qui legalitatem suam in nullo diminuerunt:</ab>
